{"overview":"«Home and Away» در شهر خیالی سامر بی، یک شهر ساحلی در نیو ساوت ولز می‌گذرد و به زندگی‌های شخصی و حرفه‌ای ساکنان آن می‌پردازد؛ این سریال در ابتدا بر خانواده فلچر (پپا و تام فلچر) و پنج فرزند پرورشی آن‌ها (فرانک مورگان، کارلی موریس، استیون ماثسون، لین داونپورت و سالی کیتینگ) که یکی از شخصیت‌های طولانی‌مدت برنامه شدند، تمرکز داشت و همچنان بر خانواده استوارت نیز متمرکز است؛ این سریال پس از پخش اولین بار در سال ۱۹۸۸ در استرالیا محبوب شد و تنها پس از چند هفته، اولین داستان جدی و تکان‌دهنده‌اش یعنی تجاوز را به تصویر کشید.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Home and Away is set in the fictional town of Summer Bay, a coastal town in New South Wales, and follows the personal and professional lives of the people living in the area. The show initially focused on the Fletcher family, Pippa and Tom Fletcher and their five foster children Frank Morgan, Carly Morris, Steven Matheson, Lynn Davenport and Sally Keating, who would go on to become one of the show's longest-running characters. The show also originally and currently focuses on the Stewart family. Home and Away had proved popular when it premiered in 1988 and had risen to become a hit in Australia, and after only a few weeks, the show tackled its first major and disturbing storyline, the rape of Carly Morris; it was one of the first shows to feature such storylines during the early timeslot. H&A has tackled many adult-themed and controversial storylines; something rarely found in its restricted timeslot.","tagline_en":"","runtime":22,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":3,"y":1988,"poster":"/mge1RHXGRm0jQl2TA503wqzsmL0.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":228,"y":1988,"poster":"/yvMNUBJ2Ofiqwe5CHSR9zPOlNCK.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":220,"y":1989,"poster":"/iicNQyQWqNhqMTH5ziObzYxrj08.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":225,"y":1990,"poster":"/dzesmbXU1YAzauiPRg8ftj5UpYi.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":242,"y":1991,"poster":"/f6TxAwPxow2AxTMf3LyI3fYk0iL.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":